<title>USA: National Realty to buy 200 offices by 97 end. [CORRECTED 22:17 GMT]</title>
<headline>National Realty to buy 200 offices by 97 end. [CORRECTED 22:17 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Realty Trust said Wednesday it expected to buy more than 200 real estate offices by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>(Corrects company name to &quot;National Realty Trust&quot; from &quot;National Realty LP&quot;)</p>
<p>It could not be immediately learned how many offices the company currently owns.</p>
</text>
